# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Full-resolution originals.
#
# Everything the site actually loads is a processed, web-sized copy
# sitting directly in assets/img/<section>/. These folders hold the
# untouched camera and phone files they were cut from — roughly
# 290 MB — which is far too heavy to commit or to deploy.
#
# They stay on your disk so you can re-crop from them at any time;
# they just never leave your machine. If you want them backed up,
# put them somewhere like Google Drive rather than in this repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
assets/img/high school/
assets/img/photography/
assets/img/sharing/
assets/img/Taiwan Community/
assets/img/projects/FAST/
assets/img/projects/Roboracer/
assets/img/projects/CNN/
